  "implementation": [
    "One immutable admitted Inputs+saved-section Arc; actual wrapper/public root children, visible DTO capacities, provenance and nested JSON populations.",
    "Snapshot/section/map handles keep original reservations through replacement and final disposal; matched lifecycle/preview readers use a single owner.",
    "Source/profile/measurement candidate validation, one complete input/document update, then infallible editor acceptance; loss/power publish paired values/sections. No-op measurement refresh uses actual dependency presence without an adapter cache.",
    "Internal generic Project borrows SectionSnapshot through unchanged validation/serialization/atomic-write behavior; legacy/current empty and complete fixture parity.",
    "Queued project inputs use target budget plus captured full SessionKey and original charged Snapshot. Foreign/stale key/budget and same-key intervening accepted-owner replacement reject before target state/path/registry changes. Accepted-owner compare/swap uses one lock; no target Context is stored in prepared models.",
    "Existing performance JSON metadata reuses the same checked actual-capacity visitor; no scientific/public/binding/dependency/schema/registration change."
  ],
